      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'A Scroll Rect can be used when content that takes up a lot of space needs
    to be displayed in a small area. The Scroll Rect provides functionality to scroll
    over this content.


    Usually a Scroll Rect is combined with a Mask in order
    to create a scroll view, where only the scrollable content inside the Scroll
    Rect is visible. It can also additionally be combined with one or two Scrollbars
    that can be dragged to scroll horizontally or vertically.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
